    "description": "Chief executive Sasan Goodarzi told staff the tax-software company will eliminate about 3,000 full-time roles to co-locate teams in strategic hubs and accelerate AI-driven product work. Affected U.S. employees were offered 16 weeks of base pay plus two weeks per year of tenure, with offices in Reno and Woodland Hills winding down. The company framed the move as a painful but necessary reinvention after months of internal review.",
